.TH proc_crypto 5 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
/proc/crypto \- ciphers provided by kernel crypto API
.SH 説明
.TP 
\fI/proc/crypto\fP
.\" commit 3b72c814a8e8cd638e1ba0da4dfce501e9dff5af
A list of the ciphers provided by the kernel crypto API.  For details, see
the kernel \fILinux Kernel Crypto API\fP documentation available under the
kernel source directory \fIDocumentation/crypto/\fP (or
\fIDocumentation/DocBook\fP before Linux 4.10; the documentation can be built
using a command such as \fImake htmldocs\fP in the root directory of the kernel
source tree).
